  "goodToKnow": "Das Futtermittel is animal feed: Kraftfutter, Futtermittelimporte. Much German livestock eats imported soy, linked to deforestation in South America. Feed scandals, such as dioxin found in 2011, led to stricter controls. Das Futter means fodder, and also the lining of a coat. Füttern means to feed. Human food is Lebensmittel. The plural is the same."
